## Title: |cFF69B4PB’s LDL Stats|r 0.1.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Counts what LibDebugLogger is holding -- entries, sessions, levels, and which tags and messages fill the log -- and prints it to chat after login. /ldlstats prints it again.
## Version: 0.1.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibDebugLogger

## A measuring tool only: it reads the log and never writes to it.

Main.lua

